known_false_positives.description:
Minor grammar/readability in the log message: consider "falling back to the earliest timestamp" (add "the") and keep message consistent with other logs. Also note this warning now changes behavior (uses earliest of create/modify) which may be worth a short mention in release notes/tests to prevent surprises.

```suggestion
      this.logger.warn(
        `No valid date found in exif tags for asset ${asset.id}; falling back to the earliest timestamp between file creation and file modification`,
      );
```
